{
  "plugins": [
    {
      "manifest": {
        "plugin_id": "mildman1848.watcharr",
        "version": "0.1.2",
        "checksum": "__CHECKSUM__",
        "silo_api_version": "v1",
        "category": "Sync/Watch Providers",
        "presentation": {
          "display_name": "Watcharr Sync",
          "summary": "Two-way watched movie and episode sync between Silo and Watcharr.",
          "description_markdown": "Synchronizes watched movies and watched TV episodes between Silo and a self-hosted Watcharr instance using Silo's watch_sync_provider.v1 pipeline. The plugin acts as a stateless protocol adapter; Silo owns scheduling, credentials, retries, ordering, and reconciliation.",
          "setup_markdown": "1. Install the plugin.\n2. Configure the Watcharr Base URL, for example `https://watcharr.example.test`.\n3. In your Silo profile, connect the Watcharr provider. Use the API key field as a Watcharr login secret: `username:password`, JSON `{ \"username\": \"...\", \"password\": \"...\" }`, or an existing Watcharr JWT copied from browser devtools. The plugin exchanges login credentials for Watcharr's bearer/JWT token and Silo stores only the returned token encrypted.\n4. Enable watched import/export for movies and episodes.\n\nDeletion/unwatched events are not exported in v1 unless Watcharr exposes a safe reversible semantics for your workflow.",
          "homepage_url": "https://github.com/mildman1848/silo-plugin-sync-watcharr",
          "source_url": "https://github.com/mildman1848/silo-plugin-sync-watcharr",
          "support_url": "https://github.com/mildman1848/silo-plugin-sync-watcharr/issues",
          "changelog_url": "https://github.com/mildman1848/silo-plugin-sync-watcharr/releases",
          "publisher_name": "Mildman1848",
          "publisher_url": "https://github.com/mildman1848",
          "license_spdx": "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
        },
        "supported_platforms": [
          {
            "os": "linux",
            "arch": "amd64"
          },
          {
            "os": "linux",
            "arch": "arm64"
          },
          {
            "os": "darwin",
            "arch": "arm64"
          }
        ],
        "capabilities": [
          {
            "type": "watch_sync_provider.v1",
            "id": "watcharr",
            "display_name": "Watcharr",
            "description": "Imports and exports watched movies and TV episodes to Watcharr.",
            "watch_sync_provider": {
              "auth_methods": [
                2
              ],
              "export_watched": true,
              "export_unwatched": false,
              "import_watched": true,
              "import_progress": false,
              "supported_media_types": [
                1,
                2
              ],
              "external_id_namespaces": [
                "tmdb",
                "imdb",
                "tvdb",
                "watcharr"
              ],
              "max_batch_size": 50
            }
          }
        ],
        "global_config_schema": [
          {
            "key": "connection",
            "title": "Watcharr Connection",
            "description": "Base URL of the Watcharr instance used by this watch-sync provider.",
            "required": true,
            "json_schema": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"base_url\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"uri\",\"minLength\":1}},\"required\":[\"base_url\"]}",
            "admin_form": {
              "fields": [
                {
                  "key": "base_url",
                  "label": "Watcharr Base URL",
                  "control": 1,
                  "placeholder": "https://watcharr.example.test",
                  "required": true
                }
              ],
              "submit_label": "Save Watcharr settings"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "repository": "mildman1848/silo-plugin-sync-watcharr",
